          "comment": "Human solving and developer review checked puzzles; comprehensive reference-answer checking is less explicit."
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "choice": "Partly",
          "comment": "Grid tasks support rule inference, but coverage of broader reasoning is not established."
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
