          "comment": "Hidden-data agreements and monitoring address exposure, but public access and leakage remain concerns."
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "choice": "Yes",
          "comment": "Development training is allowed, evaluation-specific changes discouraged and feedback-driven iteration restricted."
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "choice": "Not sure",
          "comment": "No predictive study supports performance claims beyond grid problems."
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "choice": "Partly",
          "comment": "Verified settings and human difficulty matching help, but testing routes differ and broader fairness is unresolved."
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
