          "comment": "Dated corrections and code changes are recorded, but score consequences are incomplete."
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "choice": "Partly",
          "comment": "Grid-performance claims have support; connections to broader intelligence exceed the supplied direct evidence."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "benchmark": "designqa",
      "instrument_review": "This passage-based MESA review supports DesignQA as a comparison of performance on its engineering-document tasks under stated information conditions. Practical source materials and documented task groups support relevance. Marking sensitivity, unequal information supplies and incomplete reproduction records limit interpretation. Broader engineering competence and small ranking differences require additional evidence.",
      "supported_claims": [
        "The original benchmark describes 1,451 question-answer pairs across six engineering task groups.",
        "Real rules, designs and test data connect the questions to parts of engineering work.",
        "Instructions, settings, marking methods and comparison systems are described.",
        "Changes to passages, labels, scale bars and highlighted images were tested.",
        "Public materials and marking-test files support partial inspection of the evaluation."
      ],
      "documented_problems": [
        "Coverage is narrow and uneven: one rulebook supplies the context, with 1,192 individual-rule questions and 16 performance questions.",
        "Formatting and reference-answer omissions can affect credit for otherwise valid responses.",
        "Systems receive different information supplies, including whole rulebooks or retrieved passages.",
        "All described scale-bar drawings comply, so always answering yes would earn their decision credit; actual use of that strategy is not established.",
        "Historical inputs and software are incompletely linked to results, and one answer file has fewer rows than the paper's corresponding count."
      ],
      "missing_information": [
        "Complete evidence of marking accuracy and consistency, reviewer disagreement and remaining errors is unavailable.",
        "Repeated identical runs and sufficient uncertainty information for small model differences are not established.",
        "A human-engineer baseline and evidence predicting performance on other documents or projects are absent.",
        "Systematic exposure checks, a protected test set and clear training or repeated-submission rules are not established.",
        "A clear account of revision effects, a licence file and complete responsible-reuse rules were not found in the reviewed sources."
      ],
      "reinterpretations": [
        "AI results describe the evaluated system together with its information supply, including retrieval where used; they do not isolate the underlying model.",
        "Engineering-document understanding is operationalized through six task groups using one rulebook, rather than engineering competence generally.",
        "Five passage-set evaluations test changed information supplies, rather than identical repeated runs."
      ],
      "closing_note": "No separate review method is assigned, so MESA is applied directly. The questionnaire's AI definition includes tools, making information-supply differences part of the evaluated system. Unavailable evidence is distinguished from demonstrated failure.",
      "mesa_answers": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "choice": "Yes",
          "comment": "The original 2024 benchmark, question count, groups and public scoring software are identified."
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "choice": "Yes",
          "comment": "Engineering-document abilities, tested AI systems and comparison uses are described."
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "choice": "Yes",
          "comment": "Inputs, six task types and required text or yes/no answers are described."
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "choice": "Partly",
          "comment": "Instructions, settings and information supplies are described, but exact historical conditions are incompletely linked to results."
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "choice": "Yes",
          "comment": "Text comparisons, decision credit and equal weighting of task groups are explained."
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "choice": "Yes",
          "comment": "Tasks are linked to finding, understanding and applying engineering-document information."
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "choice": "Partly",
          "comment": "Practical sources justify relevance, but one rulebook and uneven groups limit broader representativeness."
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "choice": "Partly",
          "comment": "Additional reviewers checked manually written questions, with exceptions and limited explanation checks."
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "choice": "Partly",
          "comment": "Six groups cover several activities, but document and task coverage remain limited."
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "choice": "Partly",
          "comment": "Decision and text marks track some task success, but wording and incomplete references affect credit."
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "choice": "Not sure",
          "comment": "Equal group weighting is described, but support for that choice and distinct-skill interpretations is not supplied."
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "choice": "Yes",
          "comment": "Marking-test files and examined scoring failures show testing occurred; comprehensive validation is not established."
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "choice": "Partly",
          "comment": "Random and AI baselines offer context, but information supplies differ and no engineer baseline is reported."
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "choice": "Not sure",
          "comment": "Five passage sets change the inputs and do not isolate identical-run variation."
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "choice": "Yes",
          "comment": "Effects of passages, dimension labels, scale bars and image highlighting were examined."
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "choice": "Partly",
          "comment": "Passage-set variation provides some information, but main comparisons lack adequate uncertainty detail."
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "choice": "Partly",
          "comment": "Formatting, retrieval and familiarity were examined, but unintended strategies were not fully tested."
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "choice": "Partly",
          "comment": "Image novelty and possible exposure are discussed, but systematic overlap checks and protection are not established."
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "choice": "Not sure",
          "comment": "Clear training and repeated-submission rules were unavailable."
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "choice": "Not sure",
          "comment": "Prediction of success on other documents or engineering projects is not established."
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "choice": "Partly",
